### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health


### Login admin initial
### Compte cree automatiquement au demarrage si absent:
### email = admin@sgitu.ma / password = Admin123456
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@sgitu.ma",
  "password": "Admin123456"
}


### Admin G10 - lister les comptes auth
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer COLLER_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_ICI
X-Correlation-Id: test-admin-list


### Admin G10 - changer role d'un compte auth
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/users/1/role
Authorization: Bearer COLLER_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_ICI
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-admin-role

{
  "role": "ROLE_OPERATOR"
}


### Admin G10 - activer/desactiver un compte auth
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/users/1/status
Authorization: Bearer COLLER_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_ICI
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-admin-status

{
  "enabled": false
}


### Admin G10 - marquer email verifie/non verifie
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/users/1/email-verification
Authorization: Bearer COLLER_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_ICI
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: test-admin-email

{
  "emailVerified": true
}


### Register ROLE_USER
### Apres cette requete, copier le token/lien affiche dans les logs:
### DEV email verification link for user1@sgitu.ma: http://localhost:8080/auth/verify-email?token=...
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@sgitu.ma",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}


### Login avant verification email - attendu 401
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@sgitu.ma",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Verify email
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/verify-email?token=COLLER_EMAIL_VERIFICATION_TOKEN_ICI


### Login apres verification email
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@sgitu.ma",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Forgot password
### Copier ensuite le reset token affiche dans les logs:
### DEV password reset token for user1@sgitu.ma: ...
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@sgitu.ma"
}


### Reset password
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "COLLER_PASSWORD_RESET_TOKEN_ICI",
  "newPassword": "newPassword123"
}


### Login avec nouveau mot de passe
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@sgitu.ma",
  "password": "newPassword123"
}


